			<<set _lastNPC to _player>>
			<<break>>
		<</if>>
	<</for>>
	
	<<if $dice.event.roundLoss.count(0) gt 1>>
		You try making a quick show of fulfilling your promise by giving simple pecks to each of the winners. But as you approach the last one, leaning forward,
