		You try making a quick show of fulfilling your promise by giving a simple peck to the winner, but as you lean forward 
	<</if>>
	the <<= "<<person"+_lastNPC+">>">><<person>> pulls you in, forcing you to sit on <<his>> lap.
	<br><br>

	Still stunned by the unexpected move, you lay motionless as the <<person>> cups your cheek gently, before planting a deep kiss into your lips. Your eyes open wide, shocked by the sudden bold act. You feel <<him>> force <<his>> tongue into your mouth, gleefully exploring its depths.
